st per 25g jar</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"https://youthfacebeauty.com/product/youth-face-beauty-cream-25g/\">Pack of 1</a></td><td>1 × 25g jar</td><td>₹549</td><td>₹549</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://youthfacebeauty.com/product/youth-face-beauty-cream-pack-of-2/\">Pack of 2</a></td><td>2 × 25g jars (50g total)</td><td>₹999</td><td>₹499.50</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://youthfacebeauty.com/product/youth-face-beauty-cream-pack-of-3/\">Pack of 3</a></td><td>3 × 25g jars (75g total)</td><td>₹1,444</td><td>about ₹481</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Pack of 2 costs ₹99 less than buying two single jars (₹1,098). Pack of 3 costs ₹203 less than buying three single jars (₹1,647).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The price shown on the product page when you order is the price that applies. Prices are in Indian rupees (₹) and can change, so check the page before you buy: <a href=\"https://youthfacebeauty.com/product/youth-face-beauty-cream-25g/\">Pack of 1</a>, <a href=\"https://youthfacebeauty.com/product/youth-face-beauty-cream-pack-of-2/\">Pack of 2</a> or <a href=\"https://youthfacebeauty.com/product/youth-face-beauty-cream-pack-of-3/\">Pack of 3</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div><div class=\"dsgo-shape-divider dsgo-shape-divider--bottom is-shape-inherit is-flip-y\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:designsetgo/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:designsetgo/section {\"shapeDividerBottom\":\"inherit\",\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"className\":\"is-style-shape-divider airo-section-3f6d2a12-7b1c-4e55-9a20-1c0d5b8e7f03 is-style-section-2\",\"anchor\":\"3f6d2a12-7b1c-4e55-9a20-1c0d5b8e7f03\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-designsetgo-section alignfull dsgo-stack is-style-shape-divider dsgo-stack--has-shape-divider airo-section-3f6d2a12-7b1c-4e55-9a20-1c0d5b8e7f03 is-style-section-2\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\" id=\"3f6d2a12-7b1c-4e55-9a20-1c0d5b8e7f03\"><div class=\"dsgo-stack__inner\" style=\"max-width:var(--wp--style--global--content-size, 1140px);margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"720px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":6} -->\n<h6 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Choosing a pack</h6>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Which pack should you buy?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">The right pack depends mostly on whether this is your first jar.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:separator {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Pack of 1 is the simplest place to start. One 25g jar lets you patch test, see how your skin responds and decide before you buy more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Pack of 2 and Pack of 3 bring the cost per jar down. They make more sense once you know the cream suits your skin and you plan to keep using it as part of a regular routine.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:quote {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Start with one jar if you are unsure. Buy more once you know how your skin responds.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<cite>Choosing a pack</cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>New to the cream? Read <a href=\"/youth-face-cream-skin-types-who-can-use-it/\">Who Can Use Youth Face Cream?</a> first, then follow the day and night steps on the <a href=\"/how-to-use/\">How To Use</a> page.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div><div class=\"dsgo-shape-divider dsgo-shape-divider--bottom is-shape-inherit is-flip-y\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:designsetgo/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:designsetgo/section {\"shapeDividerBottom\":\"inherit\",\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"className\":\"is-style-shape-divider airo-section-3f6d2a13-7b1c-4e55-9a20-1c0d5b8e7f04 is-style-section-1\",\"anchor\":\"3f6d2a13-7b1c-4e55-9a20-1c0d5b8e7f04\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-designsetgo-section alignfull dsgo-stack is-style-shape-divider dsgo-stack--has-shape-divider airo-section-3f6d2a13-7b1c-4e55-9a20-1c0d5b8e7f04 is-style-section-1\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\" id=\"3f6d2a13-7b1c-4e55-9a20-1c0d5b8e7f04\"><div class=\"dsgo-stack__inner\" style=\"max-width:var(--wp--style--global--content-size, 1140px);margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"720px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":6} -->\n<h6 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Ordering</h6>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">How to order and pay</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Order on the website, or ask for help on WhatsApp first.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:separator {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Choose your pack on the website and go to checkout. Payment options shown at checkout include cash on delivery, UPI, cards and net banking.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Prefer to ask a question first? Message Beauty Mart on WhatsApp at +91 99808 81230.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Youth Face Beauty Cream on this site is sold and shipped from India by Beauty Mart, Bhatkal, Karnataka. Read the <a href=\"/shipping-delivery/\">Shipping &amp; Delivery</a> and <a href=\"/refund-returns-policy/\">Refund &amp; Returns</a> pages for the details that apply to your order.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div><div class=\"dsgo-shape-divider dsgo-shape-divider--bottom is-shape-inherit is-flip-y\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:designsetgo/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:designsetgo/section {\"shapeDividerBottom\":\"inherit\",\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\"}}},\"className\":\"is-style-shape-divider airo-section-3f6d2a14-7b1c-4e55-9a20-1c0d5b8e7f05 is-style-section-2\",\"anchor\":\"3f6d2a14-7b1c-4e55-9a20-1c0d5b8e7f05\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-designsetgo-section alignfull dsgo-stack is-style-shape-divider dsgo-stack--has-shape-divider airo-section-3f6d2a14-7b1c-4e55-9a20-1c0d5b8e7f05 is-style-section-2\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\" id=\"3f6d2a14-7b1c-4e55-9a20-1c0d5b8e7f05\"><div class=\"dsgo-stack__inner\" style=\"max-width:var(--wp--style--global--content-size, 1140px);margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"720px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":6} -->\n<h6 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Comparing prices</h6>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Comparing prices fairly</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">A lower price does not always mean you are getting the same thing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:separator {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}}} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you see Youth Face Cream listed somewhere else at a different price, compare like with like: the net quantity (25g per jar), the number of jars in the pack, the seller's name and address, and the return policy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On this site, each pack lists how many 25g jars it contains and who sells it. For more on checking a listing, read <a href=\"/where-to-buy-original-youth-face-cream-avoiding-fakes/\">our guide to what to check before you order online</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<