=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Which pack has the lowest price per jar?</strong> Pack of 3, at about ₹481 per 25g jar, compared with ₹499.50 for Pack of 2 and ₹549 for Pack of 1.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Is cash on delivery available?</strong> Cash on delivery is one of the payment options shown at checkout, along with UPI, cards and net banking.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Can I order on WhatsApp?</strong> Yes. Message Beauty Mart on +91 99808 81230 and they will help with your order.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Where can I read more before I buy?</strong> Start with <a href=\"/youth-face-cream-ingredients/\">Youth Face Cream ingredients</a>, <a href=\"/youth-face-cream-skin-types-who-can-use-it/\">who can use it</a> and <a href=\"/youth-face-cream-side-effects-what-you-should-know/\">side effects: what you should know</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div><div class=\"dsgo-shape-divider dsgo-shape-divider--bottom is-shape-inherit is-flip-y\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:designsetgo/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Related reading:</strong> <a href=\"/kojic-acid-cream-price-in-india-what-youre-actually-paying-for/\">Kojic Acid Cream Price in India</a>, <a href=\"/youth-face-cream-bhatkal-karnataka/\">Youth Face Cream in Bhatkal, Karnataka</a> and the <a href=\"/how-to-use/\">How To Use</a> page. You can also go back to the <a href=\"https://youthfacebeauty.com/\">Youth Face homepage</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the price of Youth Face Cream in India?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"On this site, Youth Face Beauty Cream 25g is ₹549 for Pack of 1, ₹999 for Pack of 2 and ₹1,444 for Pack of 3.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which pack has the lowest price per jar?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Pack of 3, at about ₹481 per 25g jar, compared with ₹499.50 for Pack of 2 and ₹549 for Pack of 1.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is cash on delivery available?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Cash on delivery is one of the payment options shown at checkout, along with UPI, cards and net banking.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I order on WhatsApp?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Message Beauty Mart on +91 99808 81230 and they will help with your order.\"}}]}</script>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"max-width:720px;margin:28px auto;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid #e5e0d8;border-radius:12px;background:#faf6f2;text-align:center;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;\">Ready to try Youth Face Cream?</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:0.92em;line-height:1.6;color:#444;\">Start with a single 25g jar: <a href=\"https://youthfacebeauty.com/product/youth-face-beauty-cream-25g/\" style=\"color:#1a5c33;font-weight:700;\">Youth Face Beauty Cream 25g – Pack of 1</a>. Prefer more jars per order? See <a href=\"https://youthfacebeauty.com/product/youth-face-beauty-cream-pack-of-2/\" style=\"color:#1a5c33;\">Pack of 2</a> or <a href=\"https://youthfacebeauty.com/product/youth-face-beauty-cream-pack-of-3/\" style=\"color:#1a5c33;\">Pack of 3</a>. Patch test first and follow the directions on the pack.</p>\n<a href=\"https://youthfacebeauty.com/product/youth-face-beauty-cream-25g/\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#1a8a3f;color:#fff;padding:11px 24px;border-radius:24px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:0.9em;\">Buy Youth Face Cream 25g</a>\n</div>\n<